      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_4",
        on: "start",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Angarthing",
            text: _("Dwarves of Kal Kartha, I speak the Law. Your house is cast down; you have harbored a great evil. Who now will take the burden of cleansing this holding of its taint?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: "wesnoth-icon.png",
            text: _("The dwarves of Kal Kartha muttered among themselves and looked at one another uneasily. None stepped forward."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:store_unit",
            variable: "MODIFY_UNIT_store",
            kill: "yes",
            id: "Dulcatulos",
          },
          {
            tag: "foreach",
            variable: "MODIFY_UNIT_store",
            item: "this_item",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "hook",
                name: "command:set_variable_dynamic",
                variable: "this_item.facing",
                value: "ne",
                mode: "value",
              },
              {
                tag: "hook",
                name: "command:unstore_unit",
                variable: "this_item",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Dulcatulos",
            text: _("Loremaster... None of us is fit to take up the lordship. Karrag fooled us all, made us the tools of his foul scheme."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 1000,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:play_sound",
            file: "horse-canter.wav",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:unstore_unit",
            variable: "pelias_store",
            x: 17,
            y: 13,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Pelias",
            text: _("I was told I’d find Aiglondur of Knalga here. I bear a message from Tallin, the Lord Protector of the Alliance."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Aiglondur",
            text: _("I am he. Speak your message."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Pelias",
            text: _("I have been on your track for weeks. Some time ago the Alliance received a ragged band of refugees, hailing from a small village west of here. _ They told a tale of terror and torment; of masked dwarves and axes in the night. As Lord Protector of the Alliance and an ally to all free men, Tallin bids you vanquish this evil."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Pelias",
            text: _("To emphasize the grave importance of the matter, the Protector would dub you a Lord Companion of the Alliance should you succeed. ...although by the scene now before me, perhaps you have already?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 500,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Dulcatulos",
            text: _("(<i>Wonderingly</i>) A Lord Companion? And kin of ours..."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Narithil",
            text: _("It would be no shame for a Lord Companion to rule this holding, as Hamel does at Knalga."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: "wesnoth-icon.png",
            text: _("The Kal Karthans looked at each other, and Aiglondur, with dawning hope."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Angarthing",
            text: _("It would be fitting. The Loremasters will approve."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Aiglondur",
            text: _("Pelias, my thanks to the Lord Protector; I will attend him in the spring. But it seems that I have some work to do here first."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 2000,
          },
          {
            tag: "win",
          },
        ],
      },
    ],
  },
]
